+ 3% ATK伤害，施法期间自身处于霸体状态，受到的伤害降低60% + 2%，并回复150% + 15% ATK的生命值。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","아탈리아가 디바인 스피어로 변신하여 주변 1칸 범위 내 적에게 20% + 3% ATK의 대미지를 6회 입힌다. 시전 중 자신은 제어 면역 상태로 전환하며, 받는 대미지가 60% + 2% 감소하고 HP를 150% + 15% ATK만큼 회복한다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":64,"end":69,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":77,"end":83,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":38,"end":43,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":98,"end":103,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":117,"end":123,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":49,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":73,"end":87,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":35,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":71,"end":76,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":113,"end":127,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次造成的伤害提升至25% + 3% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","매번 입히는 대미지가 25% + 3% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":12,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次造成的伤害提升至30% + 3% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","매번 입히는 대미지가 30% + 3% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/c